      "review_description": "I have not had the system installed yet, but i found Barwon Solar to be very professional and honest. I double checked all the info they gave me and found they were spot on. I would highly reccomend them especially for people who are not 100% tech savvy. They may cost a little bit more but they use higher quality parts and panels, so im happy to pay a little bit extra. On a side note i only actually had 2 comapnies contact me Solar Barwon was same day. Sun connect was 1-2 days later and tried to sell me a system way beyond my needs. The third company didnt contact me, for your reference.",
