      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Barwon Solar was the only company that came to the house to quote.  They were also $2,000 cheaper than the next closest quote, for a system that generated 0.5kW more.  (I bought a 2kW system from Barwon Solar - next closest quote was $2,000 more for a 1.5kW system.)The system was installed within 2 weeks of paying deposit, and Stephen took care of all the paperwork etc.  All I had to do was sign contract & pay, and 2 weeks later I had fully installed system.I was a bit worried that it wouldn't look great, because I have a flat roof so the panels had to sit up on a frame.  However, they've positioned the panels so that they can't be seen at all from either the front or back yard, or across the road - only as you're driving down the street.  For best service & value, you couldn't go past Barwon Solar.  Thanks guys!",
